│ patch_description        │ This version combines the fast batched population evaluation strategy with a smoother     │
│                          │ “tight triangle” merit function and deterministic coordinate polishing. Four square       │
│                          │ corners remain fixed, guaranteeing a convex unit-area hull and making the raw minimum     │
│                          │ triangle area equal to the normalized objective. The population phase uses both direct    │
│                          │ maximin selection and a small average-of-active-constraints bonus early in the search,    │
│                          │ which helps avoid local configurations dominated by one accidental small triangle. Final  │
│                          │ coordinate-direction refinement accepts only genuine improvements to the primary          │
│                          │ minimum-area objective.                                                                   │
