│                          │ triangular convex hull, guaranteeing feasibility. Several deterministic search chains     │
│                          │ explore simultaneously, evaluating candidate perturbations in vectorized batches with an  │
│                          │ annealed lower-tail objective before a dedicated maximin polishing stage. This reduces    │
│                          │ Python-loop overhead, improves basin coverage, preserves the best exact solution          │
│                          │ independently from surrogate decisions, and keeps output deterministic.                   │
