│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ portfolio_bundle13                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This version keeps the productive 3-fold triangular geometry of the current program, but  │
│                          │ replaces its single current-to-best differential evolution loop with a mixed mutation     │
│                          │ portfolio and an active-constraint bundle polish.                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The convex hull is now explicitly scaled to have area exactly one. Global exploration     │
│                          │ uses three complementary donor styles: broad difference vectors, current-to-elite         │
│                          │ attraction, and elite-difference moves. Selection uses a lower-tail merit early in the    │
│                          │ search so configurations improve several nearly active triangles rather than only one     │
│                          │ unstable minimum constraint.                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ After global search, a deterministic soft-min bundle refinement estimates a smooth ascent │
│                          │ direction from all tight triangles using finite differences in normalized radius/phase    │
│                          │ coordinates. Every candidate is still accepted only when it improves the true minimum     │
│                          │ normalized triangle area, preserving the primary objective.                               │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
