│ patch_description        │ Canonicalize the unordered nine free points by spatial order throughout the evolutionary  │
│                          │ phase. Triangle quality is invariant under permutations of point labels, but differential │
│                          │ evolution and coordinate-wise crossover are not: without a canonical representation, two  │
│                          │ geometrically similar layouts can have unrelated point indices, causing donor differences │
│                          │ and crossover to combine incompatible locations. Sorting free points into a deterministic │
│                          │ y-then-x order makes corresponding genes represent similar spatial roles, improving the   │
│                          │ usefulness of current-to-elite DE while retaining the same feasible search space and      │
│                          │ deterministic behavior.                                                                   │
