│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ triangular_elite13                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This rewrite uses a fixed equilateral triangular hull of unit area, eliminating the       │
│                          │ restrictive four-corner square constraint while keeping the normalized objective          │
│                          │ invariant. The three hull vertices are fixed and the remaining ten points are represented │
│                          │ in folded simplex coordinates, guaranteeing that every candidate remains inside the       │
│                          │ convex region.                                                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The search combines:                                                                      │
│                          │ - diverse random, stratified, and 3-fold-symmetric initialization;                        │
