│                          │ - exact maximin incumbent tracking, with tail area used only as a tie-break.              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This removes the expensive polishing of ten candidates for 1,550 iterations each and      │
│                          │ concentrates final refinement on a small elite set.                                       │
